@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml
title Chat with Customer Sequence Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ActivationBorderColor #333333
    ActivationBackgroundColor #70C5E8
}

actor "Seller" as A
boundary "Spring Security" as SEC
control "ChatController" as CT
control "ChatService" as SV
entity "ConversationRepository" as CONVERSATIONS
entity "MessageRepository" as MESSAGES
boundary "WebSocket /ws/chat" as PUSH
actor "Customer" as OTHER
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

autonumber

A -> SEC: GET/POST /api/v1/conversations, GET/POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/messages, PATCH /api/v1/conversations/{id}/read, WebSocket /ws/chat
activate SEC
note over SEC
validate the JWT and load AuthUser into the SecurityContext
end note
alt Token missing, expired or invalid
SEC --> A: 401 AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED
else Caller is not SELLER
SEC --> A: 403 FORBIDDEN
else Token and role accepted
SEC -> CT: Forward the authenticated SELLER principal
deactivate SEC
activate CT
CT -> SV: openConversation, listMessages, markRead, sendMessage
activate SV
alt Request succeeds
SV -> CONVERSATIONS: Find by customer and seller, or create (customerId from the body)
CONVERSATIONS -> DB: SELECT or INSERT conversations
SV -> MESSAGES: findByConversationId, newest first
MESSAGES -> DB: SELECT messages
SV -> MESSAGES: markReadByRecipient
MESSAGES -> DB: UPDATE messages SET read
note over A,SV
Sending is POST /conversations/{id}/messages with an Idempotency-Key header
end note
SV -> MESSAGES: Save, or return the message stored under this key
MESSAGES -> DB: INSERT messages, UPDATE last_message_at
SV ->> PUSH: After commit, push the message to both sides
PUSH ->> OTHER: message event
SV --> CT: Use-case result
CT --> SEC: 201 Created ApiResponse<MessageResponse>
SEC --> A: 201 Created ApiResponse<MessageResponse>
else Empty message or missing Idempotency-Key
SV --> CT: BusinessException
CT --> SEC: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
SEC --> A: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
else Unknown participant, or caller not in this conversation
SV --> CT: BusinessException
CT --> SEC: 404 RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND
SEC --> A: 404 RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND
end
end

@enduml
